{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1028106001:1":{"text":"After activating the memory fragment, will we see Hewynn's memories? Chippy doesn't think she'll like that...","source_cn":"伊温小姐的记忆碎片……激活后，我们也能看到你的回忆吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECB02D41B6F2C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028106002:0":{"text":"No, it's alright... I'll try to absorb the magic. Please maintain the stability of the fragment. ","source_cn":"不，没关系的……我现在就试着吸收这片魔力，拜托你们维持...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3462156BA88A7808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028106003:0":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1028106003":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1028106004:0":{"text":"A flowing ripple of light emerges. The fragment of the past unfolds before our eyes...","source_cn":"水波般的光芒划过，一段过去的回忆展现在眼前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABE31F0EF507699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028106005:0":{"text":"Can nothing be done? I'll beg the sage again or I'll find a healer outside of our lands! I don't believe...","source_cn":"真的没办法了吗？我、我去求薄暮丛林的贤者……去丛林之外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A51E2A5024DF6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028106006:0":{"text":"...this illness... so many have tried to heal me... even Master Arden couldn't...","source_cn":"……我的病……那么多医生都没办法，连雅顿大人都这么说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33B10731284F32F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028106007:0":{"text":"I'm sorry, dear... we've been married for six months, and... I may need to break my promise...","source_cn":"对不起，亲爱的……我们结婚才半年，但……我可能做不到对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12760B6AD758F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028106008:0":{"text":"I-I'm born of the waters of the Taran River yet I can't help those who've lived here for generations...","source_cn":"我、我是从塔兰河中诞生的精灵，却没法帮助世代生活在这条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D511486342CECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","documen